    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lambert, Devan, and Jaskya are Ley Sensitives, gifted people with supernatural abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what is the story behind these powers? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join 8 different characters on a journey where they learn more about themselves, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >their talents, and how they are part of a larger plan that will decide the fate of the </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >world of Orphania and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leyline Chronicles is a classic JRPG and a tribute to the retro RPGs of the 90s and offers:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b] A vast world filled with diverse regions, monsters, bustling cities, and small side stories that all weave into the epic main storyline.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147140/extras/e14a9111c69bd3673ff4ae98b66c176c.poster.avif?t=1752502757\" width=600 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147140/extras/e14a9111c69bd3673ff4ae98b66c176c.webm?t=1752502757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147140/extras/e14a9111c69bd3673ff4ae98b66c176c.mp4?t=1752502757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></strong></li><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b] Over eight unique characters, each with side stories that reveal and explore their backgrounds and motivations.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147140/extras/78ec1b70f83e147976ffe2192ca77d8d.avif?t=1752502757\" width=524 height=232 /></span></p></strong></li><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b] A turn-based combo combat system with voice acting that rewards strategic, forward-thinking gameplay.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147140/extras/871e73efa0202aca93d0db5867388659.poster.avif?t=1752502757\" width=600 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147140/extras/871e73efa0202aca93d0db5867388659.webm?t=1752502757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147140/extras/871e73efa0202aca93d0db5867388659.mp4?t=1752502757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></strong></li><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b] Trouble Quad! A thrilling card mini-game inspired by Triple Triad. Collect powerful cards and battle your way through the secret tournament against the world\u2019s top challengers.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147140/extras/dcf482e6fd64d5976a1121b8ee126edb.poster.avif?t=1752502757\" width=600 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147140/extras/dcf482e6fd64d5976a1121b8ee126edb.webm?t=1752502757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147140/extras/dcf482e6fd64d5976a1121b8ee126edb.mp4?t=1752502757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></strong></li><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b] A streamlined crafting system that lets you upgrade weapons and armor, unlocking new skills and combos for your party.</p></strong></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lambert, Devan, and Jaskya are Ley Sensitives, gifted people with supernatural abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But what is the story behind these powers? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join 8 different characters on a journey where they learn more about themselves, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >their talents, and how they are part of a larger plan that will decide the fate of the </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >world of Orphania and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leyline Chronicles is a classic JRPG and a tribute to the retro RPGs of the 90s and offers:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b] A vast world filled with diverse regions, monsters, bustling cities, and small side stories that all weave into the epic main storyline.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147140/extras/e14a9111c69bd3673ff4ae98b66c176c.poster.avif?t=1752502757\" width=600 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147140/extras/e14a9111c69bd3673ff4ae98b66c176c.webm?t=1752502757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147140/extras/e14a9111c69bd3673ff4ae98b66c176c.mp4?t=1752502757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></strong></li><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b] Over eight unique characters, each with side stories that reveal and explore their backgrounds and motivations.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147140/extras/78ec1b70f83e147976ffe2192ca77d8d.avif?t=1752502757\" width=524 height=232 /></span></p></strong></li><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b] A turn-based combo combat system with voice acting that rewards strategic, forward-thinking gameplay.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147140/extras/871e73efa0202aca93d0db5867388659.poster.avif?t=1752502757\" width=600 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147140/extras/871e73efa0202aca93d0db5867388659.webm?t=1752502757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147140/extras/871e73efa0202aca93d0db5867388659.mp4?t=1752502757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></strong></li><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b] Trouble Quad! A thrilling card mini-game inspired by Triple Triad. Collect powerful cards and battle your way through the secret tournament against the world\u2019s top challengers.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147140/extras/dcf482e6fd64d5976a1121b8ee126edb.poster.avif?t=1752502757\" width=600 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147140/extras/dcf482e6fd64d5976a1121b8ee126edb.webm?t=1752502757\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147140/extras/dcf482e6fd64d5976a1121b8ee126edb.mp4?t=1752502757\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></strong></li><li><strong><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/b] A streamlined crafting system that lets you upgrade weapons and armor, unlocking new skills and combos for your party.</p></strong></li></ul>",
